{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本讀賣巨人隊投手桑田真澄的次子兼男星Matt，因曾公開承認花千萬日圓整容而被封為「日本蛇精男」。</p><p>真名桑田將司的他，近年吃香藝能界，今日(28日)卻驚爆涉嫌捲入3宗性侵案，其中兩名受害男子更向雜誌指控遭Matt灌酒及拍片受辱。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:14.371570+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:03:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.468807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.468807+00:00","content_hash":"2bab31c561b0c741377bc15f34d08b8bd64848eaa8d7b60cc365a13b3730077d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}